# Line endings are LF in the repository AND in every checkout. Two committed
# artifacts are compared byte for byte — the fixture snapshots (model.jsonl)
# and the schemas — and a Windows checkout that rewrote them to CRLF would
# fail the CI smoke test for a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
# The extractors themselves are indifferent (a CRLF source gives the same
# model; DeterminismTest pins it), so this is about the committed bytes only.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalized, never diffed as text by accident.
*.jsonl -text
*.png binary
*.jar binary
